---
title: Container diagram — Meridian
---
flowchart TB
    User["Workspace member<br/>Uses the collaborative IDE"]
    Mail["Resend<br/>External account-email provider"]

    subgraph Meridian["Meridian software system"]
        direction TB
        Browser["Browser SPA<br/>React, Monaco, Zustand, Yjs<br/>Editing UI and local collaboration state"]
        Edge["TLS edge and router<br/>Caddy<br/>Terminates TLS and routes traffic"]

        subgraph Private["Private application and data tier"]
            direction LR
            Static["Web container<br/>Vite build and SPA fallback<br/>Serves browser assets"]
            API["API container<br/>NestJS, REST, Socket.IO<br/>Domain logic and realtime coordination"]
            PG[("PostgreSQL<br/>Durable system of record")]
            Redis[("Redis<br/>Live fan-out and counters")]
        end

        Browser -->|"opens HTTPS requests<br/>and a WSS connection"| Edge
        Edge -->|"serves application routes"| Static
        Edge -->|"routes API and /socket.io"| API
        API -->|"Prisma transactions"| PG
        API -->|"publishes, subscribes,<br/>and updates counters"| Redis
    end

    User -->|"uses"| Browser
    API -->|"sends account email"| Mail
